sequenceDiagram
    actor Guest
    participant Channel as Channel Adapter
    participant Pipeline as handle_inbound()
    participant Guard as Guardrails
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant RAG as RAG Retrieval
    participant Tools as Tool Loop
    participant ReqSvc as Request Service
    participant Staff as Staff Console
    participant Book as Booking Store
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Redis as Redis

    Guest->>Channel: sends message
    Channel->>Pipeline: InboundMessage

    Pipeline->>DB: resolve tenant + conversation
    Pipeline->>DB: create/guest turn (persisted first!)
    Pipeline->>Redis: acquire turn lock

    Pipeline->>Guard: check_inbound(content)
    alt Injection / Abuse detected
        Guard-->>Pipeline: refuse or escalate
        Pipeline-->>Guest: safe deflection message
    else Allowed
        Guard-->>Pipeline: allow

        Pipeline->>Orch: handle(msg, ctx)
        Orch->>RAG: retrieve(tenant, query)
        RAG->>DB: pgvector cosine search
        RAG-->>Orch: top-k chunks (distance < 0.68)

        Orch->>Orch: build_system_prompt(tenant, context, slots)
        Orch->>DB: load_history(last 20 turns)

        loop Tool-calling loop (max 4 steps)
            Orch->>Tools: generate_with_tools(history, tools)
            alt LLM calls a tool
                Tools->>DB: execute tool + log Action
                Tools-->>Orch: tool result
                Orch->>Tools: feed result back
            else LLM responds with text
                Tools-->>Orch: natural language reply
            end
        end

        alt draft_reservation created
            Orch->>ReqSvc: open Request (needs_review)
            ReqSvc->>DB: insert Request row
            Orch-->>Guest: "Sent to team for review"
        end

        Orch->>Redis: release turn lock
        Pipeline->>DB: persist assistant turn
        Pipeline->>Redis: publish SSE notification
    end

    Pipeline-->>Guest: reply (streamed chunks)

    Note over Staff,Book: Staff Approval (later)
    Staff->>ReqSvc: approve Request
    ReqSvc->>DB: transition → approved
    ReqSvc->>Book: fulfil_request()
    Book->>DB: create Reservation row
    Book->>Redis: schedule_reminder(ZADD)
